From: itskenny0 <0@kenny.cat>
Subject: [PATCH] Enable vendor libhwy

libjxl exposes a vendor variant and links this library. Build the
vendor variant of its dependency as well.

---
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -35,6 +35,7 @@
 cc_library {
     name: "libhwy",
     host_supported: true,
+    vendor_available: true,
     sdk_version: "current",
     stl: "c++_shared",
     export_include_dirs: [
